    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d687">

                <pb facs="0806" n="796" xml:id="pg796"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.3516/10–148: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Dairen</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Paddock</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-10-01T17:00:00-05:00">October 1, 1948—5
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>57. Your long delayed tels now being rec’d, last dated Sept 2 and backlog
                    apparently being transmitted chronologically. Confirm receipt all Deptels
                    through this number.</p>
                <p>Your 129 Aug 28 to Dept<anchor n="15" xml:id="d687-f1"/> and 38 Aug 31 to
                        Nanking<anchor n="16" xml:id="d687-f2"/> should have been encoded. In future
                    exercise caution re material transmitted plain tels.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
